  "fixes": [
    "Intimidating uses finite bounded whole-strain input once in the selected-PC party-check workflow. It downgrades Challenge dice without deleting ordinary Difficulty dice and does not spend during previews.",
    "Side Step and Defensive Stance validate activation strain before taking a maneuver, reserve that strain while checking extra-maneuver costs, and refund it on rejection. Cancel, invalid input, Winded and blocked activation preserve resources.",
    "Master Grenadier discounts the PC Blast cost in preview and payment, including after a miss. Powerful Blast requires an actual Blast quality.",
    "Barrage uses its eligible combat skills at long/extreme range and adds damage to one hit. Its serialized single-hit subtraction prevents repeating it on additional hits after reload."
  ],
